Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.31,0:00:05.48,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,Three years ago, on that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:08.94,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,I took the First Steps entrance exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.31,0:00:14.35,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,You better remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:16.62,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,My name is Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:18.14,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,I am Luke Sykol,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:21.13,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,the invincible divine blade, \Nthe Testament Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:22.82,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:24.13,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,You are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:27.33,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,However, I was stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:29.50,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,That's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:33.92,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,Thus I, Chloe Welter, failed that exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.57,0:00:41.18,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,Afterward, I gave up on trying \Nto become a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:44.51,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,I keep my watchful eye on \Nthe hunters' activities
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:47.70,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,as the receptionist of the \NExplorers' Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:51.37,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Hello, and welcome to the Association!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:56.32,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I knew I'd heard of him somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:59.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Crashing Lightning, Arnold Hail...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.34,0:01:01.09,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So he's a level 7, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.09,0:01:02.29,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.84,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,While they were not entirely blameless,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.84,0:01:08.29,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,it's a bit of a problem that we \Nimmediately antagonized them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:11.34,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I hope the shock of being pummeled \Nmade him forget everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:16.10,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Crashing Lightning is credited with \Nhaving vanquished a thunder dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.10,0:01:18.45,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,We should settle this peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:20.84,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Let's have Branch Manager \NGark smooth this over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:22.12,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,I'll contact him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.01,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.12,0:01:26.77,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That thunder dragon, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.77,0:01:30.26,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,They're pretty tasty with teriyaki sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.26,0:01:32.15,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Teriyaki, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:32.69,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.11,0:01:35.69,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sitri's made it for me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.69,0:01:38.12,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Now I've got a craving for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:42.73,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,E-Every part of the thunder \Ndragon is rare and valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:46.11,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,I've never heard of it being used \Nas a cooking ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.11,0:01:48.24,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:50.87,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I was just thinking it would \Nbe nice if we had some.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.87,0:01:52.46,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:55.32,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:57.76,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,That woman... We can't let \Nher get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:02:00.26,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,She is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.69,0:02:04.27,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,She's probably quite a famous \Nhunter in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.15,0:02:09.41,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,But it won't end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.41,0:02:14.66,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,She will regret besmirching \Nthe name of the Falling Fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:43.02,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Stop, Drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:44.86,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Enough of your mischief!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:46.20,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Got... you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:46.88,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Wait, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:48.46,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Stop struggling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:50.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"The Falling Fog Wants Revenge."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:51.48,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 11
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:51.48,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}The Falling Fog Wants Revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:09.91,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,700)\pos(324,269)\fscx95\fscy76}Let This Grieving Soul Retire
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:24.21,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,We're {\i1}not{\i0} here out of grievance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:26.54,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:30.35,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,I heard you got kicked into \Nnext Tuesday in the pub,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:33.36,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,so I was certain you were \Nhere to file a complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:34.38,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:37.39,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,We only came to find out \Nthe name of that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:40.62,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,With her godly speed, she \Ndoesn't even cast a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:43.86,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Stifled Shadow, Liz Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.11,0:03:46.37,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:48.65,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Gark, the branch manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.65,0:03:51.11,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I've heard the rumors, Crashing Lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:53.87,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,You had a rough time just\Nafter you arrived, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.07,0:03:57.65,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I tried to have her guardian\Nput the brakes on them all...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:01.43,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Looks like he completely forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.43,0:04:02.53,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:03.94,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,He was at the pub, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:07.57,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,He might have seemed a bit out of it,\N or easygoing, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:11.27,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks, Krai Andrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:12.40,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,He's level 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:14.02,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,That guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:16.02,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Level 8?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.33,0:04:17.04,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:20.02,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,He's not one to allow anyone \Nto bully weaker people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:22.62,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,If you guys behave yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:25.16,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I'm sure he won't let Liz \Nlay a hand on you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:26.34,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:29.58,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,It looks like Thousand Tricks \Nhas a request for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:31.53,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:33.80,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,It says, "It's really good \Nwith teriyaki sauce,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:38.03,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,so please bring back some \Nthunder dragon meat."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:40.63,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Whether you take the mission \Nor not is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:45.55,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I wish you the best of luck, Dragon Slayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:49.08,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,What are we going to do, Arnold?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:51.80,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Everyone, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:56.30,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Our target is Thousand Tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:05:02.94,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Is it true that you have a debt\Nwith Sitri in the upper ten digits?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:04.83,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:07.51,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,You {\i1}do{\i0} realize how much that is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:08.69,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:10.60,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:14.00,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,One, ten, one hundred,\None thousand, ten thousand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:15.70,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,hundred thousand, a million, ten million...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.97,0:05:18.67,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,In other words, you owe \Nalmost ten billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:21.36,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,So what did Sitri say about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:24.22,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,She proposed three possible solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:30.03,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,The first one is that you throw me \Ninto prison, thus avoiding repayment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:31.94,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'd be very lonely all by myself, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:34.23,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,so be sure to lock up my \Nolder sister with me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.71,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.71,0:05:39.58,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,You haven't done anything wrong, \Nso why would you go to jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:40.73,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,What's your second idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:44.83,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Option two is that I become your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:45.49,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:48.41,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,If we're married,\Nwe can unify all our assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:52.19,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,If we did that, your debt would\Nnaturally vanish, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:55.07,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,And what's option three?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:58.99,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,That you become my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.37,0:06:02.88,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It looks like the only \Noption is getting married!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:05.12,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:07.01,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:09.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I plan to pay her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.19,0:06:11.11,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,As long as you're not wasteful,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:14.51,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,your income from the Grievers should \Nbe sufficient for eventual repayment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.73,0:06:17.92,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,If you want to pay her \Nback quicker than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:21.51,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,why not venture into a treasure \Nvault by yourself sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:23.77,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,You're telling me to go die?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:27.17,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,I'll put together a repayment plan for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:31.07,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,In the meantime, just make sure to \Nnot incur any more debt, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:31.86,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:35.17,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:40.62,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That said, it's almost auction time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:44.14,Default,Hunter1,0,0,0,,Someone who can see the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:46.80,Default,Hunter1,0,0,0,,I hear that's the kind of \Nman Thousand Tricks is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:50.72,Default,Hunter2,0,0,0,,Rumors say he reached level 8 \Nwithout ever making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:53.10,Default,Hunter3,0,0,0,,At any rate, he's supposed to be incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:55.71,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master is a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:06.19,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,It looks like no matter who you ask, \Neveryone only gives vague answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:08.80,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Anyway, he's a man full of mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:12.27,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,And it seems he rarely participates in trips \Nto the treasure vaults these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:14.19,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,leaving it all to his party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:20.11,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,There're outrageous rumors of him manifesting\Na treasure vault in front of everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:25.44,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,or sending a huge golem \Nflying with his willpower alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:27.28,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,These are silly tall tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:30.34,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,When nobody knows what's real, \Nthings always get exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.87,0:07:33.29,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,For a level 8 to look like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:35.51,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,be spoken of only in vague rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:38.36,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,and leave all treasure vaults\Nto his party instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:41.19,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:44.60,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,that he doesn't have combat \Nskills to fit his level?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:45.65,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:49.60,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,there were a few testimonies stating that \Nthey've never seen him in an actual fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:51.47,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get the picture now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:53.88,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,He's likely more of a tactician.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:57.56,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,He didn't reach level 8 \Nwith his own strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:08:00.00,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,but thanks to his party members.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:02.21,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,So he himself is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:03.75,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say he's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.03,0:08:07.74,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,But he's no match for me, someone\N who reached level 7 on his own merit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.56,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:11.51,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,That's our Arnold!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:13.38,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,They looked down on us as hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:16.30,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,We'll show the people of this capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:22.29,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,I'm going to defeat your precious Level 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:28.33,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,A debt in the upper ten digits...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:32.91,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Even with Eva taking care \Nof the repayment plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:34.63,Internal,Krai,0,0,0,,No, never mind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:39.20,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This weather's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:43.94,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If only I could forget everything \Nand dissolve into the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:48.50,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:49.50,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.73,0:08:52.28,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Is there something you need from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:53.36,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.77,0:08:58.34,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,When I looked up into the sky, \NI saw you smiling down at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:01.53,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She saw that from below?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:03.68,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,You can ask me anything at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:06.61,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,For you, I'd do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:09.23,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well then... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:12.77,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I got fooled, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:16.16,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,What do you take me for, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:18.65,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I didn't trick you. I really didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:22.44,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,So, how much money do you require?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:25.13,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I-I mean, I also need money \Nfor restocking my items
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:27.68,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,and the maintenance of my equipment...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.68,0:09:30.13,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,So there's a limit to what I can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:32.82,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No, no, I was just saying stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:36.17,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I don't intend to borrow money from you.\N It's an upper ten-digit debt, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:38.30,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Ten... digit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:42.80,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,One, ten, one hundred,\None thousand, ten thousand,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:45.02,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,one hundred thousand,\None million, ten million...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.01,0:09:49.24,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I-Impressive as ever, Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:52.22,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,To think there's someone who \Nlent you that much money...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:55.19,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I knew everybody should be in awe of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:56.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:59.43,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sitri's the one I'm borrowing from,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:02.45,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,and if it comes down to it, \Nwe'll get married, and it'll be even.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:05.13,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,M-M-Married?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:08.96,Internal,Tino,0,0,0,,Not Sitri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:11.49,Top Internal,Tino,0,0,0,,She'll definitely try to \Nhave him all for herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:12.43,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.49,0:10:15.42,Top Internal,Tino,0,0,0,,We won't be able to go on \Nwalks together anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.43,0:10:15.42,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Since you're here, why don't we \Ngo get something sweet together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.91,0:10:17.01,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,My treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.71,0:10:22.48,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Ah, sometimes we humans just \Nneed to go outside for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:26.13,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master, I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:27.63,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh? About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:29.15,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,The debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:30.18,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,The ten digits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:31.97,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,O-Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.97,0:10:35.84,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Why don't we go look for \Nrelics in treasure vaults?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.84,0:10:37.97,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,The auction's just around the corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.97,0:10:39.98,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,so maybe you could sell them for a good price.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:42.24,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,So Tino wants me to die, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:47.70,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,You probably know which treasure \Nvaults hold valuable relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:49.62,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:52.96,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If I knew that, I wouldn't \Nbe in debt to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:56.42,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,If you're too busy, I can go for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:11:01.51,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I mean, if it's not too \Ndangerous a place, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:03.77,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:07.16,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,We want to crush Thousand Tricks,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:09.89,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,but it's not like we can \Njust storm their clan HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.89,0:11:13.93,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Guess we'll just have to lie in wait \Nsomewhere and jump him when he's alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:14.66,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.49,0:11:17.14,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:19.65,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:21.30,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:24.63,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warm welcome\Nthe other day, Thousand Tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:27.41,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,You've got some balls showing \Nyourself like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:31.08,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Now I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:32.03,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,The pub incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.03,0:11:33.65,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Took you long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:34.53,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,You wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.53,0:11:36.79,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Even though I warned you he's a god?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:38.54,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,What? You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.54,0:11:40.14,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Out of the way, sweet cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:42.68,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Our quarrel is with Thousand Tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:45.36,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Let's all calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.36,0:11:47.29,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I understand why you're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:50.37,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Liz's attack caught you completely off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:51.69,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:56.33,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But look, Tino and I are on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:57.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I don't want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:11:59.60,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If you want an apology, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:01.45,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'll even get on my knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:04.60,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master! You cannot get on your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.40,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,These jerks aren't worth your...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.80,0:12:10.40,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Besides, today I'm unarmed, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:12.16,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So why don't we table this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:15.28,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Beating me when I'm not at my best \Nwon't satisfy you either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:16.90,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master is a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:21.67,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,He's just worried that you'll get beaten \Nto a pulp and lose your confidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:24.35,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Are you really so stupid that \Nyou don't realize that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:25.84,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,What... did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:27.84,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Tino, go easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:29.48,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,We wanted to get something sweet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:30.74,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:33.43,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,That's right! Master doesn't \Nhave time for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.43,0:12:36.82,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,So get that through your skulls, go wash \Nyour dirty hick faces, and try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.85,0:12:36.10,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Tino!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:36.82,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Let's calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:37.93,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Tino?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:42.49,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Er, anyway... how about we all\Njust walk away from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:44.69,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,I... think not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.69,0:12:47.40,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Fine. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:49.62,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If we're going to do this, \Nthen let's do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:51.00,Default,People,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:51.77,Default,People,0,0,0,,A fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:53.28,Default,People,0,0,0,,Looks like it's hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:56.95,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:12:59.51,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Drawing all this attention \Nin a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:00.62,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:01.97,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,But don't be careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:02.52,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:04.66,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It's two against six.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:08.29,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,There's Arnold and then his \Nfollowers A through E.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:11.65,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I thought there would be some other \Nclan members on this big street,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.65,0:13:13.02,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but it looks like nobody's around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:13.99,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.99,0:13:15.83,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,How long are you going to space out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:18.02,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Let's get this started, Level 8!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:19.92,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, A.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.52,0:13:22.77,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,How the hell do you know my name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:23.77,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Eyyy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:25.93,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Eigh, don't let him rile you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.93,0:13:26.81,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:31.05,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Just like the rumors said, \Nyou're a slippery bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:32.78,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,But I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:37.17,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Your combat power doesn't quite \Ncorrespond to your level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:39.64,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,You're a fool with no skills of your own
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.64,0:13:43.15,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,who climbed the ranks through\Nluck and the skills of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.15,0:13:45.51,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,That's the truth behind Thousand Tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.89,0:13:47.18,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.04,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:53.06,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'm not mature enough to stand \Nby idly while you insult Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.29,0:13:55.77,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Huh. I like that look in her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.69,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,She's going to be strong one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.69,0:13:58.82,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:02.37,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Girlie, while I'll admit \Nthat you've got spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.37,0:14:04.34,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,you're completely out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:05.82,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,We have no quarrel with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:07.18,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:09.32,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master, please allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:11.33,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'm going to make them regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:15.31,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:16.83,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:19.83,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:23.39,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,You're not... stopping her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:24.75,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:26.42,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If it's what you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:27.46,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,They're in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:29.60,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:32.15,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Shall we call it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:37.69,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,How dare you make fun of my Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:46.36,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,This is odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:49.43,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,You'd think Ark's team, or someone \Nfrom Obsidian Cross,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.43,0:14:53.14,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,or a member of Starlight \Nwould pass by here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:54.06,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.61,0:14:55.87,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Don't look away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:58.71,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,That girlie's fighting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:00.62,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:05.37,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Watch me properly, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:07.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:08.37,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Go, Tino!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:11.39,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You're the bestest Tino in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:14.15,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Stop with the weird cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.43,0:15:20.59,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You almost got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.59,0:15:22.69,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Just a little more, and you've got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:38.59,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,I've had it with your mockery, \NThousand Tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:41.91,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,You make a lower rank fight for \Nyou, and then to add insult to injury,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.91,0:15:44.60,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,you tell her she almost has me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.60,0:15:48.06,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Do you imagine yourself to be some \Nking, giving orders from on high?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:50.46,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Answer me, Thousand Tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:55.86,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm any kind of king,\N but you leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:16:00.22,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I just didn't want to fight you, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.47,0:16:01.47,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:04.23,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I won't go so far as to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.50,0:16:09.82,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:12.26,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,Brother, what are you even talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:15.19,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,A spell that can subdue high-level \Nhunters without killing them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:16.99,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,has a wide range,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:19.88,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,and affects nobody but your chosen targets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.88,0:16:21.33,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,You're asking for way too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:24.07,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah... I figured even you couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.41,0:16:28.59,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,I'll see what I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:35.44,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,You bastard! Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.56,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Gravity magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.41,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's called the Tyrant's Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:40.97,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's an original spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:42.79,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Impressive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.85,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,M-Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:48.46,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Please... help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:49.56,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:51.21,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Here, pull...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:51.48,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:53.48,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.48,0:16:54.49,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,So you're a mage?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:56.10,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:57.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:02.76,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Arnold, if you still want \Nto fight me after this,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:04.29,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'll set some conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:05.99,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Condi...tions...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:09.48,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I am the First Steps's clan master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:11.50,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So you have to work your way up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:17.77,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Our top parties are Obsidian Cross,\N Starlight, and Ark Brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:22.12,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If you defeat all three of them, then \NI'll consider accepting your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:25.70,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Damn you.. Thousand Tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:28.52,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:31.27,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I couldn't meet your expectations...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.27,0:17:33.32,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be sorry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:36.29,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm the one who misread the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:39.06,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Above a certain point,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.06,0:17:43.15,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I don't have a clue about a \Nhunter's level or strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:46.18,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'm so useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.18,0:17:49.71,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I don't deserve to eat this cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.00,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That's not true at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:52.71,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:54.93,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Give me a chance to redeem myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:58.24,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Please tell me where I can find a \Ntreasure vault with a valuable relic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:02.82,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I promise to bring in enough \Nto clear your ten-digit debt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.82,0:18:05.93,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:13.33,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,That's {\i1}so{\i0} hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:16.49,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Si, it broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:18.12,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I don't want this replica, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:20.20,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Bring that annoying, huge thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:22.40,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.40,0:18:25.84,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The Institute for Relic Research \Nis full of stubborn people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:28.83,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Even Krai couldn't do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.83,0:18:31.01,Top,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.69,0:18:31.01,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.20,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Guess we're done for today, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:34.91,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Speaking of Krai...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:37.47,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I heard he was attacked by Arnold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.75,0:18:40.10,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But I also heard that Ti took the guy on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:42.46,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai sure is a tough master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:44.40,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I don't think Ti could beat that guy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.70,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:48.74,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Looks like in the end, Krai \Nused the Tyrant's Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:52.74,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh, the spell that Lucia was bitching about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:54.69,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,So what do you think, Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.69,0:18:55.48,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Should we crush him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.71,0:18:57.32,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I think it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:19:00.05,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,As long as Krai doesn't order it, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:01.12,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.01,0:19:05.16,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you about every little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:05.75,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:08.75,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Verifying the truth is also part of my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:11.52,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I don't really get why,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:14.26,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,but Arnold and his gang are super mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:17.67,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,He's a hunter who rose to \Nlevel 7 by slaying a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:20.61,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,But then you acted like he\Nwasn't even worth remembering,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:24.03,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,and after that, you asked him to hunt\Na thunder dragon so you could make teriyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.71,0:19:26.40,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,You were provoking him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:28.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.19,0:19:30.60,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I never put in such a request,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:34.38,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,and everyone knows that for \Nteriyaki, chicken is much tastier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:36.65,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So I don't need the thunder dragon anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:37.71,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:41.13,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,So you're retracting the request,\Nbecause chicken is tastier anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:43.41,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Are you fanning the flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:45.04,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:50.90,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Please tell Arnold and his friends that I'll \Nnever forget about them until I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.90,0:19:53.03,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,You really want to forget about them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.03,0:19:54.59,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:57.30,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I mean, I won't forget them \Nas long as I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.81,0:20:02.14,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,So from your perspective as a level 8,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:05.56,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,what was your impression of Arnold?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:07.00,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If I had to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:09.14,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Big, rough...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:11.79,Flashback,Arnold,0,0,0,,Go home, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:16.07,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,...and likes big boobs, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:17.20,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.20,0:20:19.54,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No, that's just speculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.54,0:20:20.58,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:22.44,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,U-Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:23.28,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:26.37,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Actually, there's something \NI'd like to ask you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:30.70,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,The reason I failed my entrance \Nexam here three years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.70,0:20:32.70,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh? Three years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.70,0:20:36.36,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Back then, I was completely\N defeated by Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:38.95,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,But I was told I had promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.95,0:20:42.38,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,You're the one who said I didn't \Nmake the cut by a hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.58,0:20:45.30,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:47.84,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,What was I lacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:50.96,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I don't even have to answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.96,0:20:53.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've already \Nfigured it out yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:54.35,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.35,0:20:58.68,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If nothing else, if you tried \Nagain today, you'd pass for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.68,0:21:01.90,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But you don't have any \Nintention of joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:06.57,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You feel fulfilled working \Nfor the Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:08.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You ought to cherish the life you have now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:10.68,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Not to mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:14.02,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,there are a ton of hunters who \Nlook forward to seeing you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.69,0:21:22.63,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Now I remember the reason she failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:25.51,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Back then, she was still only fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:30.10,Sign,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,300)\bord2\u1\fs20\pos(482.251,239.562)}Chloe Welter{\fs15\u0}\N14 years old
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.60,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Just under the minimum age...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:29.88,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She hadn't turned fifteen yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:34.58,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Besides, if were to poach Chloe now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:37.00,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Gark would beat the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:46.60,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,Krai didn't give me a straight answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:51.20,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,This might be another one of \Nthe famous Thousand Trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.12,0:21:54.54,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,"An answer is worthless\Nif it's just given to you."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:57.53,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,"You've got to find it for yourself."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:02.76,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,That's what his back seemed to be saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.03,0:22:10.33,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,I guess I'll keep trying \Nto find the real answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.72,0:22:14.93,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,The day I discover it deep \Ninside me will come for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:20.51,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,Right now, I have a duty as the receptionist \Nof the Explorers' Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:25.69,Internal,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,And that is to be of help to \Nthe hunters who come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.51,0:22:31.70,Default,Chloe(M),0,0,0,,Hello, and welcome to the Association!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:32.35,Top,Arnold,0,0,0,,We have come from the Land of Fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.59,0:23:44.61,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(445.016,355.111)}By: Thunder Dragon of the Fog - Yes, Falling Fog
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.82,0:23:35.60,Top,Arnold,0,0,0,,We are from Nebulanubes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:35.59,Top,Eigh,0,0,0,,But hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.59,0:23:37.35,Top,Eigh,0,0,0,,Stifled Shadow beat us up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:38.97,Top,Juster,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks crushed us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.97,0:23:41.98,Top,Arnold,0,0,0,,On top of that, we got summoned \Nby the Association?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.98,0:23:43.98,Top,Arnold,0,0,0,,Next time on {\i1}Let This Grieving Soul{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.98,0:23:45.45,Top,Eigh,0,0,0,,{\i1}Retire{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:49.89,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 12
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:49.89,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}If Possible, I'd Like to Get It
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.45,0:23:47.47,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,What are you plotting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.47,0:23:49.64,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"If Possible, I'd Like to Get It."
